@startuml seq-a-main
title Вариант A. Основной сценарий: push доставлен с первой попытки
autonumber
participant "Платёжный\nсервис" as P
participant "Ingest API" as API
database "State DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Outbox Relay" as R
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Delivery\nOrchestrator" as O
participant "Preference\nService (Redis)" as PS
participant "Push Sender" as PW
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
participant "Мобильное\nприложение" as App
participant "Receipt\nGateway" as G

P -> API : SendNotification(source=payments, event_id=tx-42,\nclass=TRANSACTIONAL, template=debit, user_id)
API -> DB : BEGIN; INSERT notification (UNIQUE source+event_id);\nINSERT outbox; COMMIT
API --> P : 202 Accepted {notification_id}
note right of API : ~10–20 мс. Повтор с тем же event_id\nвернёт тот же notification_id (дубль не создаётся)
R -> DB : читает outbox (CDC)
R -> K : notifications.critical (key=user_id)
K -> O : notification
O -> PS : GetPreferences(user_id)
PS --> O : primary=PUSH, plan=[PUSH, SMS, EMAIL], контакты
O -> DB : UPDATE notification SET state=ATTEMPTING, channel=PUSH,\nversion=v+1 WHERE version=v;\nINSERT attempt#1; INSERT deadline(now+10s)
O -> K : channel.push.critical {attempt_id}
O -> K : inbox.write (асинхронно)
K -> PW : attempt
PW -> FCM : send(data, collapse_id=notification_id)
FCM --> PW : 200 message_id
PW -> K : delivery.events(PROVIDER_ACCEPTED, attempt#1)
FCM -> App : push
App -> G : POST /acks {notification_id, attempt_id}
G -> K : delivery.events(DELIVERED, attempt#1)
G --> App : 200 {show: true}
K -> O : DELIVERED
O -> DB : CAS state=DELIVERED; DELETE deadline
note over O, DB : Итог: ~2–4 с от события до показа на устройстве
@enduml
